TextCascade Linux Client

This repository provides a Linux clipboard client compatible with the TextCascade Server protocol.
Upstream project: https://github.com/long45343/TextCascade-Server
The upstream project is distributed under GNU GPL version 3.0. This client is also distributed under GPL-3.0; see LICENSE.

This client is a separate implementation. It does not include source files copied from the server repository. Product and project names are used only to identify protocol compatibility.
